# HC-045 reference notes

Candidate, finding, and event records are SYNTHETIC_ADAPTED_TRAINING_ONLY. The Java source paths are fixed read-only evidence.

This is a short exercise summary of public GitHub documentation, not a live review, Cloud, branch, or transmission observation.

## Boundaries to preserve

- A review finding, human assessment, request draft, prepared request, sent request, accepted request, applied change, returned material, and independently validated result are separate.
- GitHub can present a Fix with Copilot request draft and choices about where work may occur, but drafting is not transmission or permission.
- Branch, head, changed-path scope, before/source anchor/post-image, tax-rate scale, aggregation, rounding, and independent validation must be recorded separately.
- `Money.java` and `CommonRulesTest.java` are read evidence. This exercise keeps every request as an inactive draft and grants no source mutation.

## Public reference

- https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/how-tos/use-copilot-agents/request-a-code-review/use-code-review

Request sending, acceptance, Cloud branch work, source application, Java tests, commit, push, and merge remain unobserved until checked in an authorized workflow.
